{
  "id": "ag-systems",
  "chapterNumber": "6",
  "title": {
    "en": "Systems &amp; Inequalities",
    "ar": null
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "A system of equations asks where two conditions hold at once. Graphically, the solution is the point where the lines cross — and sometimes there is no such point.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Definition 6.1 — Solution of a linear system",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>A solution satisfies <em>every</em> equation simultaneously. Two lines either cross once (one solution), run parallel (no solution), or coincide (infinitely many).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve by <strong>substitution</strong> (isolate one variable and plug in) or <strong>elimination</strong> (add multiples of the equations to cancel a variable). Drag the four sliders: the amber dot is the live intersection, and parallel slopes report &ldquo;no solution&rdquo;.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "canvasId": "sysCanvas",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Two lines, one solution",
          "ar": null
        },
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "Two lines and their intersection point",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "sysDataBtn",
          "panelId": "sysDataPanel",
          "descId": "sysDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "sysDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Sampled points on each line",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "line 1: y",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "line 2: y",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "sysM1",
            "label": {
              "en": "Line 1 slope &nbsp; <b>m₁ =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -3,
            "max": 3,
            "value": 1,
            "step": 0.5,
            "valueDisplayId": "sysM1v",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Line 1 slope m₁",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sysB1",
            "label": {
              "en": "Line 1 intercept &nbsp; <b>b₁ =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -4,
            "max": 4,
            "value": -1,
            "step": 0.5,
            "valueDisplayId": "sysB1v",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Line 1 intercept b₁",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sysM2",
            "label": {
              "en": "Line 2 slope &nbsp; <b>m₂ =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -3,
            "max": 3,
            "value": -1,
            "step": 0.5,
            "valueDisplayId": "sysM2v",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Line 2 slope m₂",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "sysB2",
            "label": {
              "en": "Line 2 intercept &nbsp; <b>b₂ =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -4,
            "max": 4,
            "value": 2,
            "step": 0.5,
            "valueDisplayId": "sysB2v",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Line 2 intercept b₂",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [
          {
            "id": "sysSol",
            "label": {
              "en": "solution",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": "—",
            "colorClass": "amber"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.A — Elimination",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve \\( \\begin{cases} 2x+y=7 \\\\ x-y=2 \\end{cases} \\).</p><p>Add the equations to cancel \\( y \\): \\( 3x=9 \\Rightarrow x=3 \\). Back-substitute: \\( 3-y=2 \\Rightarrow y=1 \\).</p>\\[ (x,y)=(3,1). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.B — No solution",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve \\( \\begin{cases} y=2x+1 \\\\ y=2x-3 \\end{cases} \\).</p><p>Equal slopes but different intercepts: the lines are parallel and never meet — <strong>no solution</strong>.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Systems of equations and inequalities",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve systems by substitution, elimination, or matrices. Graph inequalities with dashed or solid boundary lines and shade the solution region.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Substitution",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Solve one equation for a variable, substitute into the other",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Elimination",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Add/subtract equations to cancel a variable",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Cramer's rule (2×2)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( x=\\dfrac{D_x}{D},\\; y=\\dfrac{D_y}{D} \\), \\( D=ad-bc \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Inequality shading",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Test a point; if true, shade that side",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve: \\( x+y=5 \\), \\( 2x-y=4 \\).</p><p>Add: \\( 3x=9 \\Rightarrow x=3,\\;y=2 \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
